{"speciesId":704,"names":{"fr":"Mucuscule","es":"Goomy","en":"Goomy","ja":"ヌメラ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"C’est le plus faible de tous les Pokémon Dragon. Pour éviter que son corps ne se dessèche, il recherche les lieux humides et ombragés."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Es el Pokémon de tipo Dragón más débil. Habita en zonas oscuras y húmedas para evitar que su viscoso cuerpo se seque."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The weakest Dragon-type Pokémon, it lives in damp, shady places, so its body doesn’t dry out."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"一番 弱い ドラゴンポケモン。 ヌメヌメの 体が 乾かないよう ジメジメした 日陰で 暮らす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Son corps est recouvert d’une membrane gluante, aussi les coups des ennemis glissent sur lui sans lui faire le moindre mal."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"La membrana mucosa que lo recubre hace resbalar tanto los puñetazos como las patadas de los enemigos que lo golpean, gracias a su viscosidad."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It’s covered in a slimy membrane that makes any punches or kicks slide off it harmlessly."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"ヌメヌメの 粘膜で 覆われた 体は 敵の パンチや キックを ヌルリと 滑らせてしまうのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"C’est le plus faible de tous les Pokémon Dragon. Pour éviter que son corps ne se dessèche, il recherche les lieux humides et ombragés."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Es el Pokémon de tipo Dragón más débil. Habita en zonas oscuras y húmedas para evitar que su viscoso cuerpo se seque."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"The weakest Dragon-type Pokémon, it lives in damp, shady places, so its body doesn’t dry out."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"一番 弱い ドラゴンポケモン。 ヌメヌメの 体が 乾かないよう ジメジメした 日陰で 暮らす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Son corps est recouvert d’une membrane gluante, aussi les coups des ennemis glissent sur lui sans lui faire le moindre mal."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"La membrana mucosa que lo recubre hace resbalar tanto los puñetazos como las patadas de los enemigos que lo golpean, gracias a su viscosidad."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It’s covered in a slimy membrane that makes any punches or kicks slide off it harmlessly."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"ヌメヌメの 粘膜で 覆われた 体は 敵の パンチや キックを ヌルリと 滑らせてしまうのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"C’est le plus faible de tous les Pokémon Dragon. Sa peau doit rester hydratée pour respirer, c’est pourquoi il préfère vivre tapi dans l’ombre."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Es el Pokémon de tipo Dragón más débil. Necesita mantener la piel húmeda para respirar, y por eso se oculta en las sombras."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"The weakest of all Dragon-type Pokémon, it’s unable to breathe if its skin dries out, so it sticks to shady places."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"最も 弱い ドラゴンポケモン。 皮膚が 乾くと 息が できないので 日陰で じーっと しているよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Son corps est recouvert d’une membrane gluante protectrice, mais pleine de germes. Lavez-vous les mains si vous le touchez !"},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Una membrana viscosa lo envuelve y lo protege, pero tiene tal cantidad de gérmenes que hay que lavarse bien las manos tras tocarlo."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Its source of protection is its slimy, germ-laden mucous membrane. Anyone who touches it needs some thorough hand-washing."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"ヌメヌメの 粘膜で 身を 守る。 粘膜は 雑菌まみれ なので 触ったら しっかり 手を 洗おう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Ses cornes lui permettent d’inspecter les alentours. Elles sont si sensibles que tout son corps se fige si on les pince."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Palpa los alrededores con sus cuernos. Estos son tan sensibles que se queda paralizado si alguien se los agarra."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It uses its horns to check out its surroundings. They’re very sensitive, so if you grab them, it will feel a strong shock and be unable to move."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"ツノで あたりの 様子を 探る。 とても 敏感なので 握られると ショックで 動けなくなってしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Son corps est majoritairement composé d’eau. Il meurt s’il se dessèche, aussi préfère-t-il vivre tapi dans l’ombre."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"La mayor parte de su cuerpo está compuesto por agua, por lo que muere si llega a secarse. Siempre se le encuentra inmóvil en la sombra."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its body is mostly water. If it dries out, it will die, so it’s always sitting with perfect stillness in the shade."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"身体の ほとんどは 水分。 乾燥すると 死んでしまうので いつも 日陰で じっと している。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Son corps est principalement composé d’eau. S’il se déshydrate, il devient tout rabougri. C’est le plus faible des Pokémon Dragon."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Su cuerpo se compone casi exclusivamente de agua, por lo que se debilitaría si se deshidratase. Es el Pokémon de tipo Dragón más débil."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Because most of its body is water, it will dry up if the weather becomes too arid. It’s considered the weakest dragon Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"体の ほとんどが 水分。 乾燥すると 干からびてしまう 最弱の ドラゴンポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ses cornes sont des organes sensoriels qui lui permettent de se cacher quand il détecte des ennemis. C’est grâce à cela qu’il vit toujours."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Sus antenas son órganos sensoriales sumamente desarrollados. Poder esconderse nada más detectar enemigos le ha permitido sobrevivir."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Their horns are powerful sensors. As soon as Goomy pick up any sign of enemies, they go into hiding. This is how they’ve survived."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"ツノは 優れた 感覚器官。 敵の 気配を 感じ取り すぐに 隠れる ことで 生き残ってきた。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Goomy hides away in the shade of trees, where it's nice and humid. If the slime coating its body dries out, the Pokémon instantly becomes lethargic."}],"varieties":[{"id":704,"moves":[{"name":"tackle","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[15,"level-up",32],[16,"level-up",32],[17,"level-up",32],[18,"level-up",32],[20,"level-up",45],[20,"machine",0],[25,"level-up",45],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"water-gun","learns":[[20,"level-up",5],[25,"level-up",5]]},{"name":"hydro-pump","learns":[[24,"level-up",43]]},{"name":"counter","learns":[[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"absorb","learns":[[15,"level-up",5],[16,"level-up",5],[17,"level-up",5],[18,"level-up",5],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"thunderbolt","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-team","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"bide","learns":[[15,"level-up",13],[16,"level-up",13],[17,"level-up",13],[18,"level-up",13]]},{"name":"bubble","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[24,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"acid-armor","learns":[[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[24,"level-up",11]]},{"name":"rest","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"rock-slide","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"